[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":81},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10},"item",{"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28,"_29":28,"_30":31,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":39,"_40":-5,"_41":-5,"_42":43,"_44":45,"_46":47,"_48":49,"_50":51,"_52":53,"_54":37,"_55":37,"_56":-5,"_57":37,"_58":59},"expiresAt",1795221640000,"id","sjin4pr8q1dp00z0igue1371g","title","CISA将4个漏洞纳入KEV Catalog，均有真实利用证据","originalTitle","CISA Adds Four Known Exploited Vulnerabilities to Catalog","summary","CISA将CVE-2025-42884、CVE-2026-76466、CVE-2026-123890和CVE-2026-129448纳入KEV Catalog，依据是这些漏洞已有在野利用证据，分别涉及SAP NetWeaver、Cisco Expressway Series、VMWare vCenter和Apache Roller。","reason","CISA依据真实利用证据将4个漏洞纳入KEV Catalog，并明确联邦机构应优先修复暴露资产上的相关缺陷。","source",{"_66":80},"links",{"_73":79},"publishedAt","2026-11-20T12:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt","2026-11-20T19:32:29.280Z","timelineAt","category","vuln","tags",[67,70,77,45,78],"score",71,"selected",true,"channel","news","story","x","readingMode","full","author","CISA","body",{"_59":72,"_73":-5,"_74":75,"_76":37},"outline",[],"relatedStories",[],"topics",[60,61,62,63],"indexable","markdownAvailable","group","hasTranslation","bodyLanguage","zh",{"_64":71,"_66":45},{"_64":69,"_66":70},{"_64":31,"_66":68},{"_64":65,"_66":67},"slug","exploited","name","在野利用","漏洞披露","vuln-mgmt","漏洞管理","cisa","<p>CISA 根据积极利用的证据，已向其<a href=\"https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog\"><u>已知被利用漏洞（KEV）目录</u></a>新增了四个漏洞。</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-42884\"><u>CVE-2025-42884</u></a> SAP NetWeaver 数据查询逻辑中对特殊元素的不当中和漏洞</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-76466\"><u>CVE-2026-76466</u></a> Cisco Expressway 系列使用硬编码凭据漏洞</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-123890\"><u>CVE-2026-123890</u></a> VMWare vCenter 使用替代路径或通道绕过身份验证漏洞</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-129448\"><u>CVE-2026-129448</u></a> Apache Roller 反序列化不可信数据漏洞</li>\n</ul><p>此类漏洞是恶意网络行为者经常使用的攻击途径，并对联邦企业构成重大风险。&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/directives/bod-26-04-implementation-guidance-prioritizing-security-updates-based-risk\"><u>业务运营指令（BOD）26-04：基于风险确定安全更新的优先级</u></a>为联邦民事行政部门（FCEB）机构确立了漏洞管理要求。BOD 26-04 强调 KEV 目录的重要性，并要求联邦机构优先快速修复高风险漏洞，具体而言，应优先修复 CISA KEV 目录中列出的、涉及公开暴露资产且在利用后可完全控制这些资产的通用漏洞披露（CVEs），同时推迟处理较低风险的漏洞。BOD 26-04 还进一步确立了机构在应用补丁前必须检查威胁行为者是否已入侵系统的基本预期。&nbsp;</p><p>尽管 BOD 26-04 仅适用于 FCEB 机构，CISA 仍鼓励所有组织采用基于风险的漏洞管理方法，并优先修复<a href=\"https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog\"><u>KEV 目录中的漏洞</u></a>。CISA 将继续把符合<a href=\"https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities\"><u>规定标准</u></a>的漏洞添加到目录中。&nbsp;</p><p>了解到当前未列入 KEV 目录的在利用漏洞？请通过 CISA 的<a href=\"https://cisasurvey.gov1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_1Zwu52kgK2OYf3w\"><u>KEV 提名单</u></a>提交，以考虑将其加入目录。潜在新增 KEV 必须具有 CVE ID、利用证据以及明确的缓解指导。&nbsp;</p>","original","zhKind","translation","complete","补丁","VMware","https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/alerts/2026/11/20/cisa-adds-four-known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog","CISA 安全公告",{"_82":83,"_84":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
